OL,5,
OL,6,F"This has been a truly tragic incident,
OL,7,Fand my thoughts remain with the
OL,8,Ffamilies of all those involved," Senior
OL,9,FInvestigating Officer Katie Smith from
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police said.
